From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Armbian board overlay <nobody@example.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 23:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: enable DT symbols for hz-evm-rk3588

U-Boot applies runtime DT overlays with "fdt apply", which resolves the
overlay's /__fixups__ entries against the base DTB's /__symbols__ node.

Since

  9f1de96cb2c8 ("kbuild: add infrastructure to build userspace programs")

mainline only passes -@ to base DTB of composite DTB (see
scripts/Makefile.dtbs, "Set -@ if the target is a base DTB that overlay is
applied onto").  A plain "%.dtb: %.dts" target therefore carries NO
__symbols__ and every overlay reference such as &pwm0 fails to resolve:

  failed on fdt_overlay_apply(): FDT_ERR_NOTFOUND / "No such node or property"

Restore symbols for this board only, exactly like upstream does for the
BananaPi DTBs (arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile):

  DTC_FLAGS_mt7986a-bananapi-bpi-r3 := -@

Needed by the MIPI-DSI panel overlay; harmless otherwise (a few KB of extra
DTB and a slightly slower boot).

Signed-off-by: Armbian board overlay <nobody@example.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
@@ -1,4 +1,9 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+# Enable DT symbols (-@) for this board so that U-Boot's "fdt apply" can
+# resolve the &label references carried by runtime DT overlays.
+# Same mechanism as upstream mediatek mt7986a-bananapi-bpi-r3 / mt8395-radxa-nio-12l.
+DTC_FLAGS_rk3588-hz-evm-rk3588 := -@
+
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += px30-cobra-ltk050h3146w-a2.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += px30-cobra-ltk050h3146w.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += px30-cobra-ltk050h3148w.dtb
--
2.45.0

